## 3. Prohibited uses

You must **not**, and must not permit or assist anyone else to:

(a) **execute, install, load or "test" the Sample** on any system that holds
real data, credentials, accounts or other people's information, or on any system
you do not own or are not expressly authorised to infect; the Sample is
provided for static study only;

(b) **download, mirror, re-upload, package, sell or otherwise redistribute the
Sample** or any extracted component of it, in whole or in part, including
through this repository's tooling;

(c) **use the Material or the Sample to cheat**, bot, gain an unfair advantage,
or otherwise violate the terms of service of any game, platform or service —
including Fortnite, Epic Games, Easy Anti-Cheat, BattlEye, or any other
anti-cheat product;

(d) **use the Material or the Sample to bypass, disable, evade, reverse the
intent of, or interfere with any anti-cheat, DRM, licensing, access-control or
security technology**, or to circumvent technical protection measures contrary
to applicable law;

(e) **use the Material to develop, train, improve, distribute or operate
malware, rootkits, kernel-mode implants, stealers, ransomware, botnets,
loaders-as-a-service, or "cheat-as-a-service" products**;

(f) **attack, scan, probe, dox, harass or otherwise harm** any person,
infrastructure or service, including the distributors of the Sample and the
hosting providers referenced in the analysis (the URLs in `analysis/IOCS.md`
must never be requested);

(g) **use the Material for any commercial purpose** (including paid courses,
paid products, consultancy deliverables that reproduce it verbatim, or
advertising-supported content that redistributes the Sample) without the
Author's prior written permission;

(h) **remove, obscure or alter** this licence, the authorship notices, or the
"educational use only" warnings from the Material or any derivative of it;

(i) **misrepresent** the Material as an endorsement of, or a tool for, the
Sample's authors or their products.

